          "distinct": true,
          "message": "Profiler: Parse and visualize NVTX marker data. (#2137)\n\nThis isn't terribly useful, but some libraries seem to provide the info,\r\nso we at least need to handle it in order to avoid errors. And if we do\r\nso, we could as well use the info to e.g. color the output.",
