          "id": "b4d42842dd7e9d0029ba8e0c982a0b6de2fbe2af",
          "message": "Split CUDA.jl into several packages (#3058)\n\nMost CUDA.jl functionality has been moved into CUDACore.jl, and the cuBLAS/cuFFT/cuSPARSE/...\nlibrary submodules have become proper packages that will be released in lockstep with CUDACore.jl\n\nCUDA.jl has become a shim package that imports and re-export all functionality it previously had,\nso this change should not be breaking.",
