          "id": "6ccd4b45c0a8c6d441796a98cfdfcf7506539b6a",
          "message": "Generate `!invarant` loads instead of `ldg` calls (#3094)\n\nLLVM 20 removed the llvm.nvvm.ldg.global.{i,f,p} intrinsics in favor\nof a regular load from addrspace(1) carrying !invariant.load metadata,\nwhich the NVPTX backend lowers to ld.global.nc (llvm/llvm-project#112834).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-04-11T07:50:25+02:00",
          "tree_id": "64f81a3cd9716bc50175df99014d0c82c79eaf2f",
