          "distinct": true,
          "id": "345c1600ebd561135148bb04ee2657f521a40e25",
          "message": "@nospecialize testf/_compare forwarders in CUDA tests. (#3117)\n\nThe main test/helpers.jl \\`testf\\` and the private clones in\nlib/cublas, lib/cufft, lib/cusolver are all thin forwarders that\ncall out to deepcopy / adapt / ≈. Each unique (f, xs...) call site\nwas getting its own compiled method even though the body does no\nper-type compute.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-04-23T22:33:02+02:00",
          "tree_id": "70906bb302a115748bb945d442a9c95f45d6dc50",
          "url": "https://github.com/JuliaGPU/CUDA.jl/commit/345c1600ebd561135148bb04ee2657f521a40e25"
