          "distinct": true,
          "id": "6dfae857de18a5fc027aa2aa194d38b846f500c1",
          "message": "Improve runtime selecton (#3134)\n\nBump CUDA_Runtime_jll to a version that selects a runtime version\nbased on the devices present in the system. Before, we only selected\nbased on the driver version. We still consider the driver version,\nbut don't simply use the newest runtime anymore, instead taking\ninto consideration whether that would rule out certain devices.",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-14T09:24:07+02:00",
          "tree_id": "b6be3d62ea8d481f91ec35759d4d75c000ab4f6b",
