          "id": "7e1e5056ae5707563163a5c2af1aed3ea0751bc4",
          "message": "cuSPARSE: Fix densetosparse for empty matrices (#2575)\n\ncusparseDenseToSparse_convert does not initialize colPtr/rowPtr when the\nmatrix is empty along the corresponding dimension, leaving them with\ngarbage. Fill with the empty-matrix sentinel (one or zero, depending on\nthe index mode) after the conversion.",
