          "distinct": true,
          "id": "37d99a985cc86b5d0c402dd4780ce53095598525",
          "message": "cuBLAS: extend norm/norm2 to strided vector views. (#2302)\n\nGeneralizes the BLAS-optimized `norm`/`norm2` methods from `DenseCuArray`\nto `StridedCuVecOrDenseMat`, so 1D strided subarray views also dispatch\nto `nrm2`. Multi-dim non-contiguous views go through the sum-based\nfallback in GPUArrays (which now dispatches on `AnyGPUArray`).\n\nResolves JuliaGPU/CUDA.jl#2280, replaces #2302.\n\nCo-authored-by: Tim Besard <tim.besard@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-16T07:32:28+02:00",
          "tree_id": "0f2eb373197854d15047a3163b0957f6484f9f07",
          "url": "https://github.com/JuliaGPU/CUDA.jl/commit/37d99a985cc86b5d0c402dd4780ce53095598525"
